      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Congenital erythropoietic porphyria is a rare error of heme metabolism. Derangement of heme metabolism leads to disfiguration, phototoxicity, and the precipitation of porphyric crises. This case report discusses the myriad perioperative considerations in a patient with congenital erythropoietic porphyria."},
